{"id":"9a0932e23b6a3de2","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-pda-configuration-notation.md","title":"73-df-pda-configuration-notation — pda configuration notation","display":"73-df-pda-configuration-notation — pda configuration notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-pda-configuration-notation","display":"73-df-pda-configuration-notation — pda configuration notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-pda-notation]]"],"aliases":["73-df-pda-configuration-notation","73-definition-5.2"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-pda-configuration-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-pda-configuration-notation — pda configuration notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a436382200a93b34\" href=\"?note=a436382200a93b34\" title=\"73-df-pda-notation\">73-df-pda-notation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-pda-configuration-notation</span><span>73-definition-5.2</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{PDA}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{PDA}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a436382200a93b34\" href=\"?note=a436382200a93b34\" title=\"73-df-pda-notation\">73-df-pda-notation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,w,\\gamma\">\\(q,w,\\gamma\\)</span> 为候选状态、输入余词与栈词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}5.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Config}_M\\coloneqq Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\Gamma^*\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}5.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Config}_M\\coloneqq Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\Gamma^*\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}5.2}\\vdash\n(q,w,\\gamma)\\in\\mathrm{Config}_M\\leftrightarrow q\\in Q\\land w\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\gamma\\in\\Gamma^*\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}5.2}\\vdash\n(q,w,\\gamma)\\in\\mathrm{Config}_M\\leftrightarrow q\\in Q\\land w\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\gamma\\in\\Gamma^*\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pda-notation","status":"resolved","id":"a436382200a93b34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-notation","status":"resolved","id":"a436382200a93b34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{PDA}$，见 [[73-df-pda-notation]]；$q,w,\\gamma$ 为候选状态、输入余词与栈词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathrm{PDA}","display":false},{"tex":"q,w,\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}5.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Config}_M\\coloneqq Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\Gamma^*","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}5.2}\\vdash\n(q,w,\\gamma)\\in\\mathrm{Config}_M\\leftrightarrow q\\in Q\\land w\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\gamma\\in\\Gamma^*","display":true}],"bytes":924,"backlinks":[{"id":"0f6dbd